    "body": "I don't think this solves the issue. We need to retain the navigation's upcoming non-traverse API method tracker before [firing the navigate error](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#abort-the-ongoing-navigation:~:text=Fire%20an%20event%20named%20navigateerror%20at%20navigation%20using%20ErrorEvent%2C%20with%20additional%20attributes%20initialized%20according%20to%20errorInfo%2E) event, because that can run script, and re-apply it afterwards.\n\n(sorry, I don't have permission to request changes)",
